abstract: >
  PackLab is a Python package for unit-aware Percus--Yevick pair correlations
  and structure factors of multicomponent hard-sphere mixtures, with
  complementary random sequential addition and Metropolis Monte Carlo workflows.
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MartinPdeS/PackLab"
keywords:
  - hard-sphere mixtures
  - Percus-Yevick
  - random sequential addition
  - Metropolis Monte Carlo
  - structure factors